{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EaHg1w9d2jESXomKFaDj7H","type":"tool_result","content":"1\timport type { Lhc, OpResult, ThreadRef } from \"lhc\";\n2\t\n3\t/** A constructed LHC session instance: the SDK (one per PI session, background\n4\t *  mode) plus the resolved thread it records into, with a flush-on-dispose\n5\t *  seam. This and the plain-data `SessionState` are the ONLY things the\n6\t *  connector retains between hooks — never a PI `ctx`/session object, which PI\n7\t *  replaces on new/resume/fork (tech design Flow 1, plain-data rule).\n8\t *\n9\t *  Defined in shared/ because both lifecycle (constructs/disposes it) and\n10\t *  capture (the converter writes through it) reference it; keeping it here\n11\t *  avoids a lifecycle↔capture import cycle. */\n12\texport interface LhcInstance {\n13\t  readonly sdk: Lhc;\n14\t  readonly threadRef: ThreadRef;\n15\t  dispose(): Promise<OpResult<void>>;\n16\t}\n17\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4562dd99-e915-4997-a6b6-c06f59211979","uuid":"858f1a26-0007-4fed-b4ed-98263a19ba21","timestamp":"2026-06-14T07:05:35.932Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/pi-lhc/src/shared/instance.ts","content":"import type { Lhc, OpResult, ThreadRef } from \"lhc\";\n\n/** A constructed LHC session instance: the SDK (one per PI session, background\n *  mode) plus the resolved thread it records into, with a flush-on-dispose\n *  seam. This and the plain-data `SessionState` are the ONLY things the\n *  connector retains between hooks — never a PI `ctx`/session object, which PI\n *  replaces on new/resume/fork (tech design Flow 1, plain-data rule).\n *\n *  Defined in shared/ because both lifecycle (constructs/disposes it) and\n *  capture (the converter writes through it) reference it; keeping it here\n *  avoids a lifecycle↔capture import cycle. */\nexport interface LhcInstance {\n  readonly sdk: Lhc;\n  readonly threadRef: ThreadRef;\n  dispose(): Promise<OpResult<void>>;\n}\n","numLines":17,"startLine":1,"totalLines":17}}}
