{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SQW52ztgDcXi8s9HWCApi7","type":"tool_result","content":"1\timport type { FormKind } from \"lhc\";\n2\t\n3\t/** The startup reachability probe's structured result (tech design Flow 5,\n4\t *  AC-5.1–5.3): which assignment lanes PI cannot reach, each with the distinct\n5\t *  fix (`unknown_model` → fix the assignment; `auth_not_configured` → log in /\n6\t *  configure auth).\n7\t *\n8\t *  Its spec'd home is inference/startup-validation.ts, which re-exports it;\n9\t *  defined here so the plain-data `SessionState.health` can reference it\n10\t *  without a lifecycle→inference import edge (keeps the surface graph acyclic). */\n11\texport interface ValidationReport {\n12\t  unreachable: {\n13\t    kind: FormKind;\n14\t    provider: string;\n15\t    model: string;\n16\t    reason: \"unknown_model\" | \"auth_not_configured\";\n17\t    fix: string;\n18\t  }[];\n19\t}\n20\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4562dd99-e915-4997-a6b6-c06f59211979","uuid":"088271bd-231c-4732-8a15-0b54b37a7d75","timestamp":"2026-06-14T07:05:36.374Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/pi-lhc/src/shared/diagnostics.ts","content":"import type { FormKind } from \"lhc\";\n\n/** The startup reachability probe's structured result (tech design Flow 5,\n *  AC-5.1–5.3): which assignment lanes PI cannot reach, each with the distinct\n *  fix (`unknown_model` → fix the assignment; `auth_not_configured` → log in /\n *  configure auth).\n *\n *  Its spec'd home is inference/startup-validation.ts, which re-exports it;\n *  defined here so the plain-data `SessionState.health` can reference it\n *  without a lifecycle→inference import edge (keeps the surface graph acyclic). */\nexport interface ValidationReport {\n  unreachable: {\n    kind: FormKind;\n    provider: string;\n    model: string;\n    reason: \"unknown_model\" | \"auth_not_configured\";\n    fix: string;\n  }[];\n}\n","numLines":20,"startLine":1,"totalLines":20}}}
